{"entity":"epic","version":1,"id":"remote-secrets","revision":1,"type":"aep.entity.create/v1","from_state":null,"to_state":"draft","changed":{"body":"## Outcome\n\nConnectors stores credential bytes in the released Secrets service while retaining provider exchange, refresh and revocation ownership.\n\n## Acceptance\n\nThe runtime uses Secrets for normal and prepared operations, preserves owner identity, and migrates Vault values without writing plaintext to disk.\n","summary":"Replace runtime Vault custody with the shared Secrets API.","title":"Use shared encrypted secret custody"},"args":{"command":"create-entity","data":{"body":"## Outcome\n\nConnectors stores credential bytes in the released Secrets service while retaining provider exchange, refresh and revocation ownership.\n\n## Acceptance\n\nThe runtime uses Secrets for normal and prepared operations, preserves owner identity, and migrates Vault values without writing plaintext to disk.\n","status":"draft","summary":"Replace runtime Vault custody with the shared Secrets API.","title":"Use shared encrypted secret custody"},"entity_type":"aep.epic/v1","locator":"ep://planning/store/epic/remote-secrets"},"payload":{"actor":"human:timo","at":1788261022259,"causation":"cmd-new-epic-remote-secrets","change":{"change":"created","status":"draft"},"correlation":"protocol-artifact-new","event_id":"epic:remote-secrets@1#0~0ccdebc78ca43b05","executor":null,"recorded_at":"2026-09-01T11:10:22Z"}}
